## Re-census (freshness guard)

Counts drift as the code evolves. Before relying on a row, recount its consumers from the project root:

```bash
grep -rl '<Symbol>' . --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=.git \
  --exclude-dir=coverage --exclude-dir=reports --exclude-dir=dist --exclude-dir=.next | wc -l
```

The grep also counts the defining file: subtract 1 before comparing with the bucket.
If the count diverges, refresh the map with `map-refresh --project <root> --brain <dir>`;
`map-refresh --brain <dir> --check` reports staleness without writing.
